svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="copyButtonSuccessIcon_ktUX"><path fill="currentColor" d="M21,7L9,19L3.5,13.5L4.91,12.09L9,16.17L19.59,5.59L21,7Z"></path></svg></span></button></div></div></div></div></div></div>{"\n"}<p>This permits us to simplify that example to:</p>{"\n"}<div class="language-js codeBlockContainer_jDV4 theme-code-block" style="--prism-color: #393A34; --prism-background-color: #f6f8fa;"><div class="codeBlockTitle_U6Q0">sidebars.js</div><div class="codeBlockContent_cKMj"><pre tabindex="0" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250);" class="prism-code language-js codeBlock_Gebt thin-scrollbar"><code class="codeBlockLines_FJaf"><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token keyword module" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">export</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token keyword module" style="color: rgb(207, 34, 46);">default</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#123;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">  </span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color: rgb(0, 92, 197);">mySidebar</span><span class="token operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">[</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line theme-code-block-highlighted-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#123;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line theme-code-block-highlighted-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token string-property property" style="color: rgb(0, 92, 197);">'Getting started'</span><span class="token operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">[</span><span class="token string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'doc1'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line theme-code-block-highlighted-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#125;</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line theme-code-block-highlighted-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">&#123;</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line theme-code-block-highlighted-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">      </span><span class="token literal-property property" style="color: rgb(0, 92, 197);">Docusaurus</span><span class="token operator" style="color: rgb(215, 58, 73);">:</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">[</span><span class="token string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'doc2'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">,</span><span class="token plain"> </span><span class="token string" style="color: rgb(198, 16, 95);">'doc3'</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">]</span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);">,</span><span class="token plain"></span><br /></div><div class="token-line theme-code-block-highlighted-line" style="color: rgb(57, 58, 52);"><span class="token plain">    </span><span class="token punctuation" style="color: rgb(57, 58